The '''Mosquito Shortbow''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Bow]] unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Spider Slayer VII}}. Its ability shoots a more powerful arrow healing  {{Stat|Health|189}} at a {{Stat|Vitality|10}} cost. It is the last bow unlocked in the  {{CollectionLink|Spider Slayer }}.

