The '''Mosquito Shortbow's''' {{AN|Nasty Bite}} can be triggered upon left-clicking. This shot costs {{Stat|Vitality|10}} to fire. Every mob hit heals the player for {{Stat|Health|189}}. This has a fixed cooldown of {{Green|0.5}} seconds regardless of the player's {{Stat|Attack Speed}}.

