== Trivia ==
*Prior to Update 0.23.4, the '''Mosquito Shortbow'''{{'}}s {{AN|Nasty Bite}} ability had no cooldown, unlike its regular attack. As a result, players could abuse this to achieve high levels of damage by spamming the ability. It was later given a hidden cooldown of {{Green|0.5s}}.

